NikoDeskIddDriver is an independent MS-PL derivative of RustDeskIddDriver
(rustdesk-org/RustDeskIddDriver, commit 448e627e2fc6238f0371f8d9963a6ad7a5925f4e),
which derives from the Microsoft indirect-display sample.
