NikoDesk changes: independent software hardware ID, interface and tracing GUIDs,
single-screen exclusive adapter, versioned bounded IOCTLs, fixed EDID-less SDR
1080p/1440p/4K modes, monitor/swapchain ownership cleanup, and consistent IddCx 1.4.
These sources are not a signed driver package. Build output must receive a valid
production catalog signature covering the exact INF and DLL before installation.
